      ],
      "camera": "close-up",
      "motion": "zoom_in",
      "visual": "A hand slams a scroll onto a stone desk, ink splatters flying. The character's face is contorted with rage, veins bulging on the forehead.",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "cao_pi",
          "text": "竟敢與劉備私通！",
          "emo": "angry"
        }
      ],
      "key": true
    },
    {
      "id": "s02",
      "location": "wei_palace",
      "characters": [
        "cao_pi"
      ],
      "camera": "medium",
      "motion": "static",
      "visual": "The character stands up abruptly, knocking over a wine cup. He paces back and forth, eyes darting nervously around the throne room.",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "猜忌，殺死了魏國前線。",
          "emo": "calm"
        }
      ],
      "key": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s03",
      "location": "wei_palace",
      "characters": [
        "cao_pi"
      ],
      "camera": "close-up",
      "motion": "static",
      "visual": "Close up on the character's hand gripping the edge of the desk, knuckles turning white. Sweat beads form on the brow.",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "cao_pi",
          "text": "召回所有前線猛將！",
          "emo": "angry"
        }
      ],
      "key": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s04",
      "location": "yiling_battlefield",
      "characters": [
        "liu_bei"
      ],
      "camera": "wide",
      "motion": "pan_right",
      "visual": "A panoramic view of the encampment at dusk. Flags flutter in the wind. Soldiers are seen moving with unusual calmness, not fear.",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "魏軍大營，空虛無助。",
          "emo": "calm"
        }
      ],
      "key": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s05",
      "location": "yiling_battlefield",
      "characters": [
        "liu_bei"
      ],
      "camera": "medium",
      "motion": "static",
      "visual": "The protagonist stands on the high ground, looking down at the valley. A cold smile forms on his lips. Wind blows his cloak.",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "liu_bei",
          "text": "孔明，他們中計了。",
          "emo": "happy"
        }
      ],
      "key": true
    },
    {
      "id": "s06",
      "location": "yiling_battlefield",
      "characters": [
        "zhuge_liang"
      ],
      "camera": "close-up",
      "motion": "static",
      "visual": "The strategist's eyes widen slightly in disbelief. He touches his feather fan, fingers trembling faintly. A mix of awe and confusion.",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "zhuge_liang",
          "text": "此計...甚毒。",
          "emo": "surprised"
        }
      ],
      "key": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s07",
      "location": "yiling_battlefield",
      "characters": [
        "liu_bei"
      ],
      "camera": "medium",
      "motion": "zoom_in",
      "visual": "The protagonist turns, the background blurring. His eyes are sharp and predatory. He points towards the distant Wei camp.",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "liu_bei",
          "text": "今夜，親率精騎。",
          "emo": "calm"
        }
      ],
      "key": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s08",
      "location": "yiling_battlefield",
      "characters": [
        "zhuge_liang"
      ],
      "camera": "close-up",
      "motion": "static",
      "visual": "The strategist looks up, realizing the danger. The shadow of the protagonist falls over him. His expression shifts to concern.",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "zhuge_liang",
          "text": "主公，這太危險了！",
          "emo": "afraid"
        }
      ],
      "key": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s09",
      "location": "yiling_battlefield",
      "characters": [
        "liu_bei"
      ],
      "camera": "medium",
      "motion": "static",
      "visual": "The protagonist ignores the warning. He mounts his war horse. The horse prances, showing restlessness. Armor glints under the moonlight.",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "liu_bei",
          "text": "危險，才是機會。",
          "emo": "disdain"
        }
      ],
      "key": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s10",
      "location": "wei_palace",
      "characters": [
        "cao_pi"
      ],
      "camera": "close-up",
      "motion": "static",
      "visual": "In the palace, the villain laughs maniacally, holding a wine cup. His eyes are dark, lacking sanity. A servant bows low, terrified.",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "cao_pi",
          "text": "曹植，你真不孝。",
          "emo": "happy"
        }
      ],
      "key": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s11",
      "location": "wei_palace",
      "characters": [
        "cao_pi"
      ],
      "camera": "medium",
      "motion": "pan_left",
      "visual": "The villain throws the wine cup on the floor. It shatters. He signals a guard to bring out the executioner's sword. Tension is palpable.",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "忠良，血染宮牆。",
          "emo": "calm"
        }
      ],
      "key": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s12",
      "location": "yiling_battlefield",
      "characters": [
        "liu_bei"
      ],
      "camera": "wide",
      "motion": "pan_right",
      "visual": "A massive dust cloud rises from the Shu camp. Hundreds of cavalry emerge, moving silently but with terrifying speed. The camera follows the leading rider.",
      "lines": [
        {
          "speaker": "narrator",
          "text": "虎豹之師，出動了。",
          "emo": "calm"
        }
      ],
      "key": false
    },
    {
      "id": "s13",
      "location": "yiling_battlefield",
      "characters": [
        "liu_bei"
      ],
      "camera": "close-up",
      "motion": "zoom_in",
      "visual": "The protagonist holds his reins tightly. The wind whips his hair. His face is set in stone, eyes locked on the distant fire of the Wei camp.",
      "lines": [
        {
